This project is a Rust reimplementation of the relay server of gnirehtet
(https://github.com/Genymobile/gnirehtet), Copyright (C) 2017 Genymobile,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. Its protocol and design are
followed, and some unit-test vectors are ported from its test suite.

apk/gnirehtet.apk is the unmodified gnirehtet v2.5.1 Android client from the
official release (Copyright (C) 2017 Genymobile, Apache License 2.0).

Release archives also contain adb from Google's Android SDK Platform-Tools,
redistributed unmodified; see adb-NOTICE.txt in the archive for its licenses.
